  },
  {
   "turn_id": 3,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "Understood — the first one's color goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: The cut here is the one I reach for constantly.",
   "images": [
    "white/solid_formal_shirt.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 5,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:15",
   "text": "So that cut is your default shape. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 6,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:16",
   "text": "Also in the bag: I've tried this print more than once and it has never worked.",
   "images": [
    "green/striped_long_coat.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 7,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:17",
   "text": "Tried and settled, then. That print goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 8,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:18",
   "text": "Big closet purge tonight. The keep pile and the donate pile are both growing.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 9,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:19",
   "text": "Brutal honesty hour. What's surviving?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 10,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:20",
   "text": "Whatever else changes, these three keep the same cut. That's on purpose.",
   "images": [
    "white/solid_slacks.jpg",
    "beige/floral_slacks.jpg",
    "black/solid_slacks.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 11,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:21",
   "text": "Deliberate repetition. The cut is yours.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 12,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:22",
   "text": "Next out of the pile: These two look nothing alike, but they share exactly one thing — and that shared color is my favorite.",
   "images": [
    "pink/solid_polo_shirt.jpg",
    "pink/floral_long_coat.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 13,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:23",
   "text": "Spotted it. Whatever color those two have in common belongs to you.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 14,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:24",
   "text": "Same sort: Completely different pieces, one shared print. That print is why I own all of them.",
   "images": [
    "white/checkered_long_coat.jpg",
    "green/checkered_tank_top.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 15,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:25",
   "text": "The common thread is the print. Understood.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 16,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:26",
   "text": "My aunt's birthday box arrived. Mixed results, as usual.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 17,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:27",
   "text": "Aunt boxes are pure gambling. How did the wheel land?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 18,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:28",
   "text": "Same everything, two cuts. The second one is my shape.",
