   "turn_id": 21,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:31",
   "text": "One point of overlap, and it's the one that counts. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 22,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:32",
   "text": "Next out of the box: Here's the same thing twice, split only by the color — and the first one wins easily.",
